[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9900.469, "timestamp": "02:45:00", "text": "但他似乎被允許休息幾天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.07, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "。真奇怪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9906.63, "timestamp": "02:45:06", "text": "是的。 Nibora-chan 也休假了，這是怎麼回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9937.23, "timestamp": "02:45:37", "text": "看起來不像。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9944.75, "timestamp": "02:45:44", "text": "學校內設有專門的場地供測試新設備。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9948.269, "timestamp": "02:45:48", "text": "我希望如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9950.23, "timestamp": "02:45:50", "text": "希望"}]